 /files/13505106" data-api-returntype="File" loading="lazy"></p>\n<div id="
 kl_custom_block_0">\n<h2>Checkpoint: Introduce Yourself</h2>\n<p>This is n
 ot a quiz\, but we are using the quiz format to help us accomplish the pur
 pose of this Checkpoint assignment. In this first checkpoint of the semest
 er\, we’ll spend a few minutes getting to know each other. I want to und
 erstand why you enrolled in REL C 333 and what you expect to get out of th
 is course. I also want to help you determine how you can prepare to be suc
 cessful\, including some realistic goals for completing the course.</p>\n<
 p>Your responses don’t need to be lengthy\, but please be specific and t
 horough because I would sincerely like to know you as a student. This will
  help me remember you and interact more successfully throughout the semest
 er.</p>\n<p>You will submit your answers by the indicated deadline and the
 n receive some feedback from your instructor within a few days. <strong>Ch
 eck back to read the response from your Instructor team\, and then make an
 other comment to follow up with any questions or observations by the <em>f
 ollowing</em> week.</strong> <span style="color: #800000\;"><em>Note: Clic
 k on your Account photo on the left blue sidebar and\, under the Notificat
 ions tab\, make sure you have selected to receive notifications for Submis
 sion Comments. <span class="phpally-ignore" style="color: #333333\;">If yo
 u added the class on or after the first due date of the semester\, please 
 mention so in your response so that you will not be marked late for your i
 nitial submission.</span></em></span></p>\n</div><script src="https://inst
 ructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_74070000000000001/attachments/840
 9019/dp_app.js"></script>
